    McpToolCount("Tools reported (up to 100 names shown):","报告的工具数（最多显示 100 个名称）：","Bàogào de gōngjù shù (zuìduō xiǎnshì yībǎi ge míngchēng):"),
    McpAbsent("Configuration is absent.","配置不存在。","Pèizhì bù cúnzài."),
    ManagementReviewChanged("The reviewed target or configuration changed. Review it again before sending.","已核查的目标或配置已更改。发送前请重新核查。","Yǐ héchá de mùbiāo huò pèizhì yǐ gēnggǎi. Fāsòng qián qǐng chóngxīn héchá."),
    ManagementReadbackPending("The server acknowledged the action, but its current configuration could not be verified. Read the current configuration before another change.","服务器已确认操作，但无法验证当前配置。再次更改前请读取当前配置。","Fúwùqì yǐ quèrèn cāozuò, dàn wúfǎ yànzhèng dāngqián pèizhì. Zàicì gēnggǎi qián qǐng dúqǔ dāngqián pèizhì."),
    ManagementOutcomePending("Review the uncertain management outcome before another action on this profile. Requests are never repeated automatically.","对此配置执行其他操作前，请核查不确定的管理结果。请求不会自动重复。","Duì cǐ pèizhì zhíxíng qítā cāozuò qián, qǐng héchá bù quèdìng de guǎnlǐ jiéguǒ. Qǐngqiú bú huì zìdòng chóngfù."),
    ManagementAlreadyObserved("The requested configuration is already present. No change was sent.","请求的配置状态已存在。未发送更改。","Qǐngqiú de pèizhì zhuàngtài yǐ cúnzài. Wèi fāsòng gēnggǎi."),
    ManagementObservationOnly("This is a current configuration observation. It does not settle an uncertain earlier action.","这是对当前配置的观察，不能确定先前不确定操作的结果。","Zhè shì duì dāngqián pèizhì de guānchá, bù néng quèdìng xiānqián bù quèdìng cāozuò de jiéguǒ."),
